Applies to the migration tooling and templates written for this project —
everything under `scripts/` and `layouts/`.

It does NOT apply to:
  - `scripts/drupal_filters.py`
    A port of Drupal 7's text filters — `_filter_autop()` in particular is a
    direct translation of the original implementation, quirks included. A
    translation is a derivative work, so this file is GPL-2.0-or-later, the
    same as the code it came from.
  - `layouts/partials/drupal/*.html`
    Markup extracted from Drupal's rendered output (Bartik theme templates).
    Also GPL-2.0-or-later.
  - `static/themes/bartik/`, `static/modules/`, `static/sites/`, `static/misc/`
    Drupal core CSS and images, verbatim. GPL-2.0-or-later.
    See https://www.drupal.org/about/licensing
  - `content/`, `data/`, `static/files/`
    Site content. See CONTENT-LICENCE.md

